    </section>

    <div class="mk-trust">
        <div class="mk-wrap">
            <div class="mk-trust-panel">
            <ul>
                <li style="--mk-trust-bg:#cfe4ff">
                    <span class="mk-trust__ico"><i class="bi bi-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                    <div><b>Livraison rapide</b><span>Chez vous ou en boutique</span></div>
                </li>
                <li style="--mk-trust-bg:#c9f2d9">
                    <span class="mk-trust__ico"><i class="bi bi-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                    <div><b>Paiement s&eacute;curis&eacute;</b><span>Vos donn&eacute;es restent priv&eacute;es</span></div>
                </li>
                <li style="--mk-trust-bg:#ffe2b8">
                    <span class="mk-trust__ico"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                    <div><b>&Eacute;change facile</b><span>Si la taille ne va pas</span></div>
                </li>
                <li style="--mk-trust-bg:#ffd3e6">
                    <span class="mk-trust__ico"><i class="bi bi-chat-dots" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                    <div><b>Une question ?</b><span>Notre &eacute;quipe vous r&eacute;pond</span></div>
                </li>
            </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mk-section" id="univers">
        <div class="mk-wrap">
            <div class="mk-sec-head">
                <div>
                    <h2>Pour qui cherchez-vous ?</h2>
                    <p>Choisissez un univers pour voir tout le catalogue.</p>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="mk-more" @onclick="GoCatalogGridAsync">Voir tout le catalogue</button>
            </div>
            <div class="mk-universes">
                <button type="button" class="mk-tile mk-tile--girls" @onclick="GoCatalogGirlsAsync">
                    <img class="mk-tile__photo" src="images/home/univers/tile-girls.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <div class="mk-tile__content"><h3>Filles</h3><p>Robes, hauts color&eacute;s et tenues de f&ecirc;te.</p></div>
                    <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Voir les articles Filles</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="mk-tile mk-tile--boys" @onclick="GoCatalogBoysAsync">
                    <img class="mk-tile__photo" src="images/home/univers/tile-boys.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <div class="mk-tile__content"><h3>Gar&ccedil;ons</h3><p>Sweats, jeans et tenues du quotidien.</p></div>
                    <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Voir les articles Gar&ccedil;ons</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="mk-tile mk-tile--baby" @onclick="GoCatalogGridAsync">
                    <img class="mk-tile__photo" src="images/home/univers/tile-baby.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <div class="mk-tile__content"><h3>B&eacute;b&eacute;</h3><p>Bodies, pyjamas et premi&egrave;res tenues.</p></div>
                    <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">D&eacute;couvrir</span>
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="mk-tile mk-tile--gear" @onclick="GoCatalogGridAsync">
                    <img class="mk-tile__photo" src="images/home/univers/tile-gear.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <div class="mk-tile__content"><h3>Chaussures &amp; accessoires</h3><p>Baskets, sacs et essentiels.</p></div>
                    <span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Parcourir</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
